<description><![CDATA[<div><div class="tgme_widget_message_text js-message_text" dir="auto"><b>GTA6未获准中国销售，R星仍在抖音宣传；网传直播指引血液改绿</b><br/><br/>《GTA6》11月19日全球发售，该系列从未获准在中国大陆销售。据游民星空报道，抖音知名主播女流66开播不久直播间便疑似遭封禁。<br/><br/>游民星空此前披露，抖音主播群流出未公开的直播合规引导，禁止严重伤害和暴露着装画面，并建议用“色盲模式”把红色血液改成绿色。有外媒指，中国规定平台不应直播未获批游戏，若指引落实，主播或被迫避开构成GTA特色的内容（据称指引禁止偷车、攻击平民、与警察打斗）。<br/><br/>据路透社报道，R星正通过抖音认证账号向数十万中国粉丝宣传，R星与国家新闻出版署均未回应置评。《南华早报》视频提到，深圳游戏顾问称当局对玩家经外区商店购买“睁一只眼闭一只眼”；一名中国玩家说，没有正版引进，“你反而可以很自由地玩这个游戏”。<br/><br/><a href="?q=%23%E6%B8%B8%E6%88%8F">#游戏</a> <a href="?q=%23%E5%AE%A1%E6%9F%A5">#审查</a> <a href="?q=%23%E5%B7%B2404">#已404</a> <a href="?q=%23%E7%9C%8B%E9%89%B4">#看鉴</a><br/><br/><i class="emoji" style="background-image:url('//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F9497.png')"><b>🔗</b></i>原文链接<br/>《游民星空》<a href="https://www.gamersky.com/news/202611/2246244.shtml" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">抖音发布《GTA6》直播规范：大尺度内容要遮挡</a><br/>《南华早报》<a href="https://www.scmp.com/video/lifestyle/3375106/why-grand-theft-auto-vi-might-succeed-mainland-china-despite-sales-ban" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">Why Grand Theft Auto VI might succeed in mainland China despite a sales ban（为何《GTA6》未获准销售，仍可能在中国大陆成功）</a><br/>《路透社》<a href="https://www.reuters.com/technology/rockstar-promotes-gta-vi-china-despite-lack-sales-approval-2026-11-18/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">Rockstar promotes GTA VI in China despite lack of sales approval（R星未获销售批准，仍在中国宣传《GTA6》）</a><br/>《新闻周刊》<a href="https://www.newsweek.com/entertainment/gta-6-sex-violence-crashing-china-censorship-rules-12732758" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">GTA 6&#39;s Sex &amp; Violence Is Crashing Into China&#39;s Censorship Rules（GTA6的性与暴力撞上中国审查规则）</a><br/>《游民星空》<a href="https://www.gamersky.com/news/202611/2248967.shtml" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">《GTA6》开播没多久就出事！女流直播间疑似被封禁</a></div><p><img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/VPmGXeUcM4mdxhDDL32NMgB3ED4skKubww5iFgTxDhPqexNsRNtV7x41eLEe1aN9SMpT0MTIKkTTKwXWwr-clPhbLCZmrw1UjapD9lKGXZgbTvm_OFGkVn14hfmsQX12DXbVViLwRTkXJfUjDHrLNxuyTldj1Niku4kI4MFNpKVvhtkogWUBuHFuLrEtLUpRdrueehk4JBFaXJ0knyukJ_z_lsBoJIetYbsjCH6lDc9eviin31CxCs69VRcUVzFo9VWeLTXKvQdB5nahvlfVr_EtGb-cy_2KMc-Fc4QsMnpC2tJkscIiFaleeX1eLkZvxc9X3d6C9lHj80AMwg334A.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/r1nhFDbm_h0u2MM3z9Myd4d_WdrzQXiaRslcK1VJcYDgEjbGHnw4xOuweMklNRjJHMTVQGYRClMP2TKEBlt-r08iLTbJMADQ4XJ2fEL-pMdjzl81McPaBVGn-XcS5a-yOskLDFKiq4ihRTyY2nk9vwmxZ7lVH7nd7tbSPYi2bksJ95iyFgY-qJuRkjrjVr_pCCF4VrAmNVDL3NUOX26Gm8Vk0zsfG0UoFk_1v-pjrXrhjRl2E6wKSiBWIMV1b42a28h0BnbuK-6d70vxEhlc5jBIY6KietjPAzcH0_gSB3WCndUvUcSYBCD8WupHNXuS0BA993SPW_cbwZUoLS4VCQ.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/h0YnjrnAvJGZehkop7H_Ln0jAa5BJuG7YrQxREVCGp4NhIyowmTebw0j7lr-Zq3hdtoxo4hyUpRTG6HrOohHUsLZrOqNmZvjDISzltzhZ0i_a3Tel1CNfaeDLg9znSE2KrSAHsvgVQptkGheuC12PstHeguc0yvgkFl6zK11o2Zxy6Zt1yA4aHumM598BekLjkw6blrHZ2GrB_bp91AvA7avSJuyOE3moWAcFmMctiEXVNe3oDRmeX-tJJblWnmdG3isKQAIcUIuNlbzrpg7szx4Z4CsZ7c3bSB6itVpUaCA5Yisp_JfR2B_8i12u9j78YuVYC2rZ8uBpir4_gohvw.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/ZfydSLQgCjYDfMNqcvVSvE8xJCbL0kCWMN-DiicECTgC33zPq8vWzG-_XKG_kn0P6CgTVqd2275KxTYLXtUN9Zfip-nbKXkiEB0T-0qHpjwDusZ3oJCpeKbRFr7IQCYRxH6H5usd1OytkMDxeamZgugr3mBiV76VJoy1R_jxx_hKNGRvwhiVsXaH0WGrkY9aBTqN9vKsQjFR5DkPJgzHxQKnNiN0VVdYJApa5Ip44MEjb_Cg_HvvemAOiVnqp7ZV_PzUHA57kyfloVXl-u6x-ZWUTBe_mwE4a5HfoS0ZZnNQBRN9BsSTLxth6IZV6MWlDeDzs2T5ervYAwk8ypOtag.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img